{"_id": "6aed10d9dfd73b4a31bf00f3", "id": "Hebrish/October-7-Memorial-Sentence-Bank", "author": "Hebrish", "sha": "1b111617729d2a2fb8bdecfde37875eafecb259d", "lastModified": "2026-11-08T14:27:06.000Z", "private": false, "gated": "auto", "disabled": false, "tags": ["task_categories:automatic-speech-recognition", "task_categories:text-to-speech", "language:en", "license:cc-by-4.0", "size_categories:1K<n<10K", "format:json", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:polars", "library:mlcroissant", "region:us", "memorial", "sentences", "read-speech"], "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOctober 7 Memorial Sentence Bank\n\t\n\n\n  \nSentence dataset, split-out. Text to read for one topic, with no audio. Subset of Hebrish/Master-Sentence-Bank (private), which holds every sentence. Recordings: Hebrish/October-7-Memorial-Sentences. How every dataset fits together: the dataset index.\n\n\nThis dataset is dedicated to those who were murdered and who fell on October 7, 2023. Reading their names aloud is an act of remembrance, and it helps speech models write those names… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Hebrish/October-7-Memorial-Sentence-Bank.", "downloads": 365, "likes": 0, "cardData": {"license": "cc-by-4.0", "language": ["en"], "task_categories": ["automatic-speech-recognition", "text-to-speech"], "pretty_name": "October 7 Memorial Sentence Bank", "tags": ["memorial", "sentences", "read-speech"], "size_categories": ["1K<n<10K"]}, "siblings": [{"rfilename": ".gitattributes"}, {"rfilename": "README.md"}, {"rfilename": "data/train.jsonl"}], "createdAt": "2026-11-05T23:27:21.000Z", "usedStorage": 207731},
{"_id": "6aed148197b8ebab7e230ba4", "id": "Hebrish/Example-Sentence-Bank", "author": "Hebrish", "sha": "931fdfd8d8a60b95426ffc72f0d87840b0c3e14b", "lastModified": "2026-11-06T01:19:22.000Z", "private": false, "gated": "auto", "disabled": false, "tags": ["task_categories:text-generation", "language:en", "license:cc-by-4.0", "size_categories:n<1K", "format:json", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:polars", "library:mlcroissant", "region:us", "reference", "format-standard", "hebrish"], "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tExample Sentence Bank\n\t\n\nThis is the Hebrish project's reference for the sentence dataset format. It is the example a new sentence dataset\ncopies, and sentence.schema.json beside it is the checkable form. The sentences are invented and neutral; they teach\nnothing and are never trained on.\nTopic datasets carry these columns as their sentences tab (2026-11-06): see Example-Audio-Sentences, which shows both tabs in one repo.\n\nPair: Example-Audio-Sentences is the reference for the… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Hebrish/Example-Sentence-Bank.", "downloads": 1284, "likes": 0, "cardData": {"license": "cc-by-4.0", "language": ["en"], "task_categories": ["text-generation"], "pretty_name": "Example Sentence Bank (format reference)", "size_categories": ["n<1K"], "tags": ["reference", "format-standard", "hebrish"], "configs": [{"config_name": "default", "data_files": [{"split": "train", "path": "data/train.jsonl"}, {"split": "test", "path": "data/test.jsonl"}]}]}, "siblings": [{"rfilename": ".gitattributes"}, {"rfilename": "README.md"}, {"rfilename": "data/test.jsonl"}, {"rfilename": "data/train.jsonl"}, {"rfilename": "sentence.schema.json"}], "createdAt": "2026-11-05T23:42:57.000Z", "usedStorage": 22226},
